      "generated_answer": "The decision to divide Korea at the 38th parallel led to the establishment of two separate governments—North and South Korea—which remains in effect today. This division ultimately resulted in the ongoing separation of the Korean Peninsula into two distinct nations.  \n\n\\boxed{C}",
