      "generated_answer": "The excerpt expresses deep distrust of the two major political parties, accusing them of serving wealthy interests and ignoring the people's suffering—hallmarks of populist sentiment focused on economic justice and anti-corruption. This aligns most closely with Bernie Sanders in 2016, who criticized the influence of big money in politics and called for a political revolution on behalf of the working class. \n\n\\boxed{F}",
