    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What do Homo sapiens and Australopithecus afarensis have in common?\n\nOptions: \nA. a shared ability to use complex tools\nB. a similar diet\nC. a reliance on brachiation\nD. an identical social structure\nE. a mode of locomotion\nF. the same lifespan\nG. the same geographical distribution\nH. a lack of sexual dimorphism\nI. the same language capability\nJ. all the above\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
