    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The excerpt reflects the Roman perspective of viewing internal conflicts among Germanic tribes as beneficial to Rome, emphasizing delight in their mutual destruction. This demonstrates a strategic satisfaction in the disunity of potential threats, revealing a concern about barbarian attacks. The correct answer is therefore concern over the security posed by united barbarian groups.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
