of revolutionary ideas among the British working class in the eighteenth century\nF. an increase in the use of child labor in eighteenth-century Britain\nG. the replacing of traditional laborers by machines in the industrialization of Britain in the eighteenth century\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
