    "global index": "MMLUPro_history_4837",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What does Australia have in common with the rest of the world during the Holocene epoch?\n\nOptions: \nA. the emergence of complex social hierarchies and political systems\nB. a growth in cultural diversity\nC. the formation of a single global civilization\nD. the onset of a new ice age\nE. the introduction of farming from neighboring continents\nF. the complete extinction of megafauna\nG. the independent domestication of wheat and cattle\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
