to move around Jupiter.\nH. The universe is a finite space.\nI. Stars are smaller than planets.\nJ. Venus and Mercury do not revolve around the sun.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
