    "prediction": "mistralai/ministral-3b-2512",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **B. Depth First search**.\n\nDepth-first search often leads to exploring a single path to its deepest extent before backtracking, which can result in \"blind alleys\" (dead ends) where no solution is found before moving on to alternative paths. In contrast, breadth-first search, A* (with proper heuristics), and bidirectional search are more systematic in avoiding unnecessary detours.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 100,
        "output_tokens": 83,
