      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef medianOfUniquenessArray(nums):\n    n = len(nums)\n    uniqueness = []\n    \n    # Calculate distinct elements for all subarrays\n    for i in range(n):\n        seen = set()\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            seen.add(nums[j])\n            uniqueness.append(len(seen))\n    \n    # Sort the uniqueness array\n    uniqueness.sort()\n    \n    # Find the median\n    length = len(uniqueness)\n    # If odd length, return middle element\n    # If even length, return the smaller of the two middle elements\n    median_idx = (length - 1) // 2\n    return uniqueness[median_idx]\n```",
