      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{\\text{**Persuasion**}}\n\nAn **injunctive message** (a message that prescribes behavior, e.g., \"Do this\") can backfire by triggering the **boomerang effect** in persuasion when recipients perceive it as conflicting with their self-image or values, leading them to reject the message instead of adopting it. This effect is most commonly studied in social psychology.",
