    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10473",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A short dipole has a radiation resistance R_r=\\surd(\\mu_0 / \\epsilon_0) [(\\betal)^2 / 6\\pi] ohms. FindA_emthe maximum effectiveaperture of this dipole.\n\nOptions: \nA. 0.075 \\lambda^2\nB. 0.200 \\lambda^2\nC. 0.180 \\lambda^2\nD. 0.089 \\lambda^2\nE. 0.102 \\lambda^2\nF. 0.119 \\lambda^2\nG. 0.134 \\lambda^2\nH. 0.145 \\lambda^2\nI. 0.160 \\lambda^2\nJ. 0.050 \\lambda^2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
