      "generated_answer": "To represent **110 codewords**, the minimum number of bits required is calculated using logarithms:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Number of bits} = \\lceil \\log_2(110) \\rceil = 7 \\text{ bits}\n\\]\n\nThe efficiency is the ratio of the actual number of bits used to the theoretical minimum for decimal (base-10) representation:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Efficiency} = \\left( \\frac{\\log_{10}(110)}{\\log_{10}(2)} \\right) \\times 100 \\approx 89\\%\n\\]\n\nThus, the correct choice is **\\boxed{I}**.",
