{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "mistralai/ministral-3b-2512",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The decision to break into the home is made by **Dickson McCunn**, who, despite his initial hesitation, overcomes his fear and chooses to enter through the veranda rather than the coal hole to aid the noblewoman’s rescue.\n\n\\boxed{Dickson McCunn}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 853,
        "output_tokens": 60,
        "total_tokens": 913
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
