    "prediction": "mistralai/ministral-3b-2512",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Dr. Bill Capa travels to Los Angeles to escape the psychological trauma of his patient’s suicide in New York, seeking a fresh start with his friend Dr. Bob Moore. The move also allows him to reconnect with his professional identity by taking over Moore’s therapy group, providing a sense of purpose amid his grief. Additionally, it serves as a transitional phase before confronting deeper emotional and psychological challenges tied to his past experiences. \\boxed{To heal from his depression and rebuild his life by immersing himself in a new environment and therapeutic role.}",
