    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The phrase **\"In pace requiescat\"** is a Latin phrase meaning **\"May he rest in peace.\"**\n\nIn Poe’s *The Cask of Amontillado*, it appears as the epitaph on the tomb of Fortunato, symbolizing his final, silent burial. The phrase underscores the cruel, irreversible nature of the narrator’s revenge.",
