      "generated_answer": "Norman’s socialist commune failed due to **lack of unity and discipline**—his socialist friends abandoned him when he enforced strict labor rules. **Internal conflicts** (e.g., Wolf’s authoritarian control, Catherine’s departure) and **external resistance** (the island’s lawlessness) undermined the experiment. Ultimately, **authority and order** (restored by his father and governor) replaced the idealistic vision.",
